ston-Salem, NC 27103, USA</aff><author-notes><corresp id="cor1">*Harold J. Sheedlo</corresp></author-notes><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><year>1991</year></pub-date><volume>2</volume><issue>1</issue><fpage>55</fpage><lpage>63</lpage><permissions><copyright-statement>Copyright &#x000a9; 1991.</copyright-statement><copyright-year>1991</copyright-year></permissions><abstract><p>Maximal PRC rescue was affected by RPE-cell transplantation in retinas of RCS dystrophic rats at early stages of the retinal disease, while little or no rescue was detected when transplantation was performed at late time periods.</p></abstract></article-meta></front></article>